 #: src/sparql/querying.md:198
 msgid ""
-"The rdflib compatibility shim passes `initBindings` to the native engine as "
-"substitutions, so `purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., initBindings=...)` "
-"refuses a reassignment as `Store.query` and `Store.prepare` do."
+"The rdflib compatibility shim compiles contextual mappings in Rust through "
+"the shared native evaluator. `purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., "
+"initBindings=...)` keeps initial bindings separate from returned mappings "
+"and permits RDFLib's variable reassignment, including nested groups, "
+"`OPTIONAL`, `MINUS`, `EXISTS` and grouping. Public results retain the "
+"original variable names and suppress empty projected mappings. "
+"`Store.query`, `Store.prepare` and SHACL retain their native pre-binding and "
+"assignment rules."
 msgstr ""
-"rdflib 兼容层把 `initBindings` 作为替换传给原生引擎，因此 "
-"`purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., initBindings=...)` 与 `Store.query` "
-"和 `Store.prepare` 一样拒绝重新赋值。"
+"rdflib 兼容层在 Rust 中编译上下文映射，并通过共享的原生求值器执行。"
+"`purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., initBindings=...)` 将初始绑定与返回映"
+"射分开，允许 RDFLib 的变量重新赋值，包括嵌套组、`OPTIONAL`、`MINUS`、"
+"`EXISTS` 和分组。公开结果保留原始变量名，并不迭代空的投影映射。"
+"`Store.query`、`Store.prepare` 和 SHACL 保留其原生预绑定和赋值规则。"
 
